# Current public identity of the repository. scripts/dev/set-repo-identity.sh
# reads these as the values to replace and rewrites this file after a run.
# See docs/maintainers/repo-setup.md. Not a secret: every value here is
# already public in the tracked files. Keep it equal to what the tracked files
# say (SECURITY.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, MAINTAINERS.md, .github/CODEOWNERS):
# the script finds a value to replace by searching for it.
